<section id="faq" class="section faq-section" data-src="sections/product-faq.liquid" style="padding: 70px 0; background: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 840px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
      <div class="badge badge-accent" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">❓ GOT QUESTIONS?</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about grounding technology, sizing, and our 30-day guarantee</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details style="background: var(--color-bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px 24px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-primary); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>What makes BRONOIR shoes different from other barefoot shoes?</span>
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--color-accent);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
          BRONOIR combines barefoot ergonomics with grounding technology using real pure copper. This allows you to not only move naturally with zero drop and wide toe box, but also maintain direct electrical contact with the Earth's natural surface charge.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details style="background: var(--color-bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px 24px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-primary); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>How does the grounding (Earthing) function work?</span>
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--color-accent);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
          Each BRONOIR shoe features a pure copper plug integrated into the sole that maintains direct conductivity between your foot's meridian points and the ground. Copper is an exceptional conductor, allowing beneficial free electrons to flow naturally into your body.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details style="background: var(--color-bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px 24px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-primary); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>How should I choose the right size?</span>
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--color-accent);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
          We recommend selecting your regular shoe size for a snug barefoot feel. Because of our wide anatomical toe box, your toes will have ample room to splay naturally without needing to size up. If you are between sizes, we recommend sizing up for winter boots.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details style="background: var(--color-bg-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 18px 24px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-primary); list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>How does the Buy 1, Get 2 Free promotion work?</span>
          <span style="font-size: 20px; color: var(--color-accent);">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;">
          Simply select the 3-pair bundle or add 3 eligible pairs to your cart. The discount is automatically applied at checkout—you only pay for 1 pair and receive 2 additional pairs completely free of charge!
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
